WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.891 --> 00:00:15.050
Roxy called to her friends.

2
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.582
"I have to go home," she said.

3
00:00:17.582 --> 00:00:23.787
"I have to . . . um . . . study for tomorrow's math quiz!"

4
00:00:23.787 --> 00:00:26.039
Roxy ran off.

5
00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:28.145
Terrell scratched his head.

6
00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:34.912
"We don't have a math quiz tomorrow."

7
00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:39.307
Roxy flew over Metro City.

8
00:00:39.307 --> 00:00:42.121
She saw a bus crash on West Street.

9
00:00:42.122 --> 00:00:46.252
People were running in every direction, waving their arms and screaming.

10
00:00:46.252 --> 00:00:50.988
"Those people must be running from the monster pets," thought Roxy.

11
00:00:50.988 --> 00:00:53.410
She flew down to the street.

12
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:57.194
Monster pets were everywhere.

13
00:00:57.194 --> 00:01:02.178
"My poodle is attacking me!" cried an old man.

14
00:01:02.179 --> 00:01:08.442
"WOOF! WOOF! Grr!" The poodle snapped at the man's feet.

15
00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:11.345
A cat swatted at an old lady's cane.

16
00:01:11.346 --> 00:01:14.485
"Bad kitty!" cried the lady.

17
00:01:14.486 --> 00:01:18.375
A large man ran from a tiny dog that was breathing fire.

18
00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:22.528
"Run for your lives!" shouted the man.

19
00:01:22.529 --> 00:01:25.740
"Rocket Girl!" cried a voice.

20
00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.878
It was Detective Smith.

21
00:01:27.878 --> 00:01:31.004
He was hiding behind a crashed car.

22
00:01:31.004 --> 00:01:33.602
A woman was with him.

23
00:01:33.602 --> 00:01:37.944
Roxy saw a dog with spiky fur bite a tire off the car.

24
00:01:37.945 --> 00:01:41.054
The dog's collar was glowing.

25
00:01:41.054 --> 00:01:43.950
Roxy flew over to the car.

26
00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.186
The dog ran away.

27
00:01:48.187 --> 00:01:50.947
"Hi, Detective," said Roxy.

28
00:01:50.947 --> 00:01:55.470
"I think you need to take your dog to dog training school!"

29
00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:59.472
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

30
00:01:59.472 --> 00:02:03.338
"That's not my dog, Rocket Girl."

31
00:02:03.338 --> 00:02:06.480
"He's my dog," said a woman.

32
00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.104
"His name is Ralphie."

33
00:02:09.104 --> 00:02:13.573
"Does Ralphie always act like that?" asked Roxy.

34
00:02:13.573 --> 00:02:18.152
"Of course not," said the woman. She smiled proudly.

35
00:02:18.153 --> 00:02:20.984
"He wins awards all the time.

36
00:02:20.985 --> 00:02:26.201
He was cute and furry this morning. But now . . ." The woman cried.

37
00:02:26.201 --> 00:02:32.050
"He looks like a monster! Oh! Poor Ralphie!"

38
00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.917
"How did this happen?" asked Detective Smith.

39
00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:37.814
"Did Ralphie eat anything strange today?"

40
00:02:37.814 --> 00:02:40.804
"No." The woman shook her head.

41
00:02:40.805 --> 00:02:44.051
Roxy glanced around.

42
00:02:44.051 --> 00:02:46.658
The monster pets were gone.

43
00:02:46.658 --> 00:02:50.204
"I wonder where they went," she thought.

44
00:02:50.205 --> 00:02:54.108
"What else did Ralphie do today?" asked Detective Smith.

45
00:02:54.109 --> 00:02:56.545
The woman thought for a moment.

46
00:02:56.545 --> 00:03:02.533
"After he ate, I took him to a wonderful new pet salon—Mr. Snippy's.

47
00:03:02.533 --> 00:03:05.622
Ralphie got a haircut and a manicure.

48
00:03:05.622 --> 00:03:08.388
Mr. Snippy is a lovely man.

49
00:03:08.389 --> 00:03:12.635
He gave Ralphie a new collar that glows."

50
00:03:12.635 --> 00:03:15.230
A man with a beard ran over.

51
00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.598
He wore sunglasses and a white tennis outfit.

52
00:03:18.599 --> 00:03:22.808
"Monster pets are invading Metro City Park!" the man shouted.

53
00:03:22.808 --> 00:03:24.994
"A dog ate the tennis net.

54
00:03:24.994 --> 00:03:27.487
Then a cat ate my racket!"

55
00:03:27.487 --> 00:03:29.930
"Uh-oh," thought Roxy.

56
00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:36.044
"Terrell, Mara, and Jack are at Metro City Park!"
